                    trace.statement("FUN_1801a1910(\"Autowall\",\"aim_autowall\",uVar18,");
                    trace.statement("\"Keeps a target whose direct ray is blocked when the weapon pack\\'s\\nown penetration maths says the bullet still arrives.\\n\\nSupported packs: ArcCW, ARC9, TacRP, SWCS, TFA (incl. Insurgency),\\nM9K, CW 2.0, SWB (incl. the UT fork), FA:S 2.0. Each one is\\nmodelled separately - budgets, material tables and damage loss\\nare that pack\\'s own numbers, not a shared guess.\\n\\nSilent on a pack with no wallbang, and on a server that has turned\\nits pack\\'s penetration convar off.\\n\\nHomigrad/Z-City has its own, older autowall with its own switch\\nunder Compensation > Gamemode support - that pack ricochets and\\nfires from the world model\\'s muzzle, so it needs its own simulator.\"");
