                    trace.statement("FUN_1801a1910(\"Lead uncompensated bodies\",\"lead_uncomped\",uVar18,");
                    trace.statement("\"The server rewinds PLAYERS when it traces your bullet, and nothing\\nelse. A body that is not a player - the prop_ragdoll a downed\\nHomigrad player actually is, or an NPC - is hit where it stands NOW,\\nwhile you aim where it was drawn: cl_interp + ping ago. Moving\\nbodies miss, still ones do not.\\n\\nOn = shift the aim point by that body\\'s measured velocity. Players\\nare never touched, so backtrack keeps working as it does today.\"");
