                        trace.statement("local_218 = (char *)0x0;");
                        trace.statement("FUN_1801a1910(\"Steady barrel (aim None)\",\"gm_v4_zcity_hold\",uVar18,");
                        trace.statement("\"Stops the crosshair shaking on aim mode None.\\n\\nThe solved angle is written to your real view, that turns\\nthe gun, and the gun\\'s new position changes the next\\nsolution - a loop that rings at a few Hz and looks like\\nthe aimbot is picking random angles around the head.\\n\\nThis holds the barrel correction between ticks and only\\nre-takes it once the gun has stopped moving. Tracking is\\nnot slowed: the angle to the target is still rebuilt every\\nframe, only the gun-offset part is held.\\n\\nSilent and PSilent never move your view, so this does\\nnothing there.\"");
                        trace.statement(");");
